{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_479997533#0_985523054","relevance":3,"reason":"This Reuters fact-check is dedicated to the exact viral claim that undocumented immigrants get healthcare for free and directly states the claim is false: undocumented immigrants do not get the same health insurance coverage or health care for free.","learned":"Direct fact-check evidence: undocumented immigrants do not generally get free healthcare; Medicare has premiums for seniors and undocumented immigrants do not receive equivalent free coverage or care."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ politifact snopes factcheck \"fact check\") (+ undocumented \"illegal immigrants\") (+ medicaid healthcare \"health care\" \"free\"))","reason":"Search for additional fact-checks from PolitiFact, Snopes, or similar sources addressing claims that undocumented immigrants receive free healthcare or Medicaid."}}
