{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1460094563#7_3022742398","relevance":3,"reason":"The PolitiFact fact-check is dedicated to the exact claim that undocumented immigrants get Medicare for free and directly states that undocumented immigrants do not have access to standard federal Medicare or Medicaid insurance programs.","learned":"PolitiFact evidence: undocumented immigrants do not get Medicare for free and do not have access to standard federal Medicare or Medicaid insurance programs."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1380","reason":"The fact-check query is producing direct grade-3 evidence from credible claim-checking sources; continue to find additional direct documents on free healthcare/Medicaid claims for undocumented immigrants."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1380"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1460094563#0_3022713652","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1380","rank":3,"snippet":"terrorists in Israeli conflict.” Photo shows a “Palestinian boy cleaning his own family’s blood.” Says Luc Montagnier said, “There is no hope and no possible treatment for those who have been vaccinated already. We must be prepared to incinerate the bodies.” You can’t donate plasma after getting a COVID-19 vaccine. The CDC in mid-May quietly changed its international travel recommendations to require fully vaccinated people to test negative for COVID-19 before flying to the United States. Support independent fact-checking. Become a member! \" , \"segment\": \"<cover>PolitiFact | No, undocumented immigrants don't get Medicare for free</cover>Facebook posts stated on January 31, 2019 in a Facebook post: Undocumented immigrants get Medicare for free. Immigration Medicare Facebook Fact-checks Facebook posts By Ciara O'Rourke February 27, 2019 No, undocumented immigrants don't get Medicare for free A recent Facebook post laments that senior citizens have to pay for federal health care benefits while undocumented immigrants enjoy the insurance gratis. \"Why do seniors on Social Security have to pay for Medicare and a supplemental (insurance) and the illegals get it all for free?\" asks a post published on the Columbian Post’s "}}
