{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_1653084586#3_3432835757","relevance":2,"reason":"The KFF issue brief directly states undocumented immigrants are ineligible for Medicaid and explains ACA Marketplace coverage is for legal residents, but the document is primarily about ACA coverage eligibility after job loss rather than dedicated to whether undocumented immigrants get free healthcare.","learned":"Undocumented immigrants are ineligible for Medicaid; ACA Marketplace coverage and subsidies are generally for legal residents who meet other eligibility rules."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1380","reason":"The fact-check query has produced multiple grade-3 documents directly addressing claims that undocumented immigrants get Medicare or healthcare for free; continue it for the final remaining judgment."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1380"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_49_1460094563#2_3022721480","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1380","rank":5,"snippet":"people to test negative for COVID-19 before flying to the United States. Support independent fact-checking. Become a member! \" , \"segment\": \"The page also includes this disclaimer: \\\" We’re a growing paper. We don’t report fake news. We share OPINIONS, and News UPDATES. When we make mistakes we correct them. Please refrain from making snap judgements which are not true at all.\\\" We wanted to ask the Post for more information about its claim that undocumented immigrants get Medicare for free but it wasn’t possible to send a message to the account on Facebook and there’s no contact information on its website. So we started researching the statement. Who is eligible for Medicare? The U.S. Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services did not directly respond to PolitiFact’s query about whether the Facebook post’s claim is accurate.\" , \"start_char\": 1163.000000 , \"title\": \"<cover>PolitiFact | No, undocumented immigrants don't get Medicare for free</cover>\" , \"url\": \"https://www.politifact.com/factchecks/2019/feb/27/facebook-posts/no-undocumented-immigrants-dont-get-medicare-free/\" }"}}
